   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "FROM THE FRONT OF THE VEHICLE THE BUMPER COVER SHOWS TO BE MISSING TWO FRONT SMALL TRIANGLE COVERS, CUSTOMER SAYS THAT SHE HIT A SMALL POLE GOING REVERSING OUT OF A PARKING SPOT. THE FRONT BUMPER IS MISALIGNED MIGHT NEED SOME MINOR WORK, PAINT LOOKS TO BE OK. FRONT FENDERS SHOW GOOD, HOOD HAS A HARD TIME CLOSING MIGHT HAVE SUBSEQUENT DMAGE FROM THE CUSTOMER HITTING THE POLE. THE TOP OF THE VEHICLE IS IN GREAT CONDITION. EXTERIOR DOOR PANELS AND BOTH REAR QUARTERS ARE IN GREAT SHAPE. REAR LIFTGATE IS IN GREAT CONDITION OPENS AND CLOSES WELL. REAR BUMPER COVER IS NICE AND CLEAN. ALL EXTERIOR LIGHTS ILLUMINATE AND WORK WELL AS DESIGNED. SUNROOF WORKS AS DESIGNED"
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "THE INTERIOR IS IN GREAT CONDITIONS, VERY WELL KEPT, NO FLAWS OR RIPS. ALL ELECTRICAL PUSH BUTTONS WORK WELL. WINDOW SWITCHES AND WINDOW MOTORS WORK AS DESIGNED. A/C AND HEATER CONTROL HEAD UNIT RADIO WORK AS DESIGNED; SPEAKERS SOUND CLEAR. INSTRUMENT CLUSTER ILLUMINATES WELL AS DESIGNED. POWER SEATS WORK WELL AS DESIGNED."
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "ENGINE COLD START SOUNDS GOOD NO SMOKE OR NOISES VERIFIED AT THIS TIME. ENGINE FLUIDS AND ALL OTHER FLUIDS ARE CLEAN AND NO INTERMIX VERIFIED. NO EXTERNAL LEAKS AT THIS TIME. TRANSMISSION SHIFTS GOOD NO SLIPPING OR ANY INTERNAL DIFFERENTIAL ISSUES VERIFIED DURING ROAD TEST. NO CURRENT DTC'S AT THIS TIME DURING DIAGNOSTIC SCAN."
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
